   "lines": [
    "Broke camp and",
    "started for Island",
    "Falls in the batteau",
    "- a clumsy looking",
    "craft. Sewell paddled,",
    "Dow and I rowed,",
    "Thomson trolled, and",
    "West and Emlen,",
    "with rifle and",
    "shot gun, watched",
    "from the bow for",
    "loons and ducks.",
    "We made very good",
    "time; I spent the",
    "afternoon tramping",
    "through the woods",
    "with West."
   ],
